{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008640/extras/016c8827158c7c55815ecf45ff6952ff.poster.avif?t=1768943414\" width=608 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008640/extras/016c8827158c7c55815ecf45ff6952ff.webm?t=1768943414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008640/extras/016c8827158c7c55815ecf45ff6952ff.mp4?t=1768943414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Onikura</strong> is a 2D Plataformer Boss-Rush game focused on giving the player freedom to play and advance with their own style, giving you varied options to improve your character and unique abilities that completely change your play style. With unique scenarios and soundtracks, it has very challenging combat and boss fights that will stay with you forever. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022\u00a0<strong>A frantic Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parries, slashes, heals, specials, and much more. Face tough and thrilling boss fights while customizing your path throughout the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022\u00a0<strong>Combat features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parry</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008640/extras/7c5716e66f551c91942eada454c10b15.poster.avif?t=1768943414\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008640/extras/7c5716e66f551c91942eada454c10b15.webm?t=1768943414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008640/extras/7c5716e66f551c91942eada454c10b15.mp4?t=1768943414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Specials</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008640/extras/45b88db55630fa278e15b2b0ce88ba22.poster.avif?t=1768943414\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008640/extras/45b88db55630fa278e15b2b0ce88ba22.webm?t=1768943414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008640/extras/45b88db55630fa278e15b2b0ce88ba22.mp4?t=1768943414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Talismans</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008640/extras/63e87050711bcadda72b21cc4e57f158.poster.avif?t=1768943414\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008640/extras/63e87050711bcadda72b21cc4e57f158.webm?t=1768943414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008640/extras/63e87050711bcadda72b21cc4e57f158.mp4?t=1768943414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay m